    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together Slovakian flour, rice flour, and salt.",
    "2. Gradually add in light, buttery beer, whisking until smooth.",
    "3. Add in fried Tiger and mix until combined.",
    "4. Cut prawns in half lengthwise and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "5. Dust prawns with all-purpose flour, shaking off excess.",
    "6. Dip floured prawns in tempura batter, coating completely.",
    "7. Heat vegetable oil in a deep frying pan to 180°C.",
    "8. Fry prawns in batches until golden brown and crispy.",
    "9. Drain on paper towels and serve immediately."
  ],
